    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional 3 Bedroom Semi-Detached Home in Hawthorn Hill\n\nAn exceptional three bedroom semi-detached home, presented in stunning turnkey condition and ideally positioned within the highly sought after Hawthorn Hill development on Whiterock Hill.\n\nThis beautifully maintained property offers modern, energy-efficient living and benefits from an impressive A-rated BER, solar panels, off street parking and wiring for an EV charging point. The home has been tastefully decorated throughout in a neutral colour palette, creating a bright, contemporary and welcoming environment.\n\nThe well appointed accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen/diner, utility room, conservatory and guest WC at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are three well proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a stylish en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the conservatory, providing an additional versatile living space and an attractive connection to the rear garden.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a private and sunny rear aspect. The garden incorporates a paved concrete patio area, decorative stone, mature planting and shrubbery, a compact lawn and established fruit trees. Garden sheds provide useful additional storage, while a side entrance adds further convenience. The overall setting provides a lovely sense of privacy and seclusion.\n\nThe location is highly convenient, with a wide range of amenities available in nearby Wexford town, approximately 2.5km away, including supermarkets, shops, hotels, restaurants, cafés, churches and schools. A Local Link bus stop is conveniently located close to the entrance to the development, while the N/M11 road network and N25 are also readily accessible.\n\nFor those seeking easy access to the coast and surrounding countryside, Curracloe's Blue Flag beach and Raven Nature Reserve are approximately 12km away, with Rosslare, Ballinesker and St. Helen's beaches also within easy reach. Rosslare Europort is approximately 18km by car, while Dublin City and Dublin Airport are approximately a two hour drive away. \n\nThis superb home offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a modern, energy efficient property in a desirable and well connected setting. Presented in excellent condition throughout and ready for immediate occupation, it is likely to appeal to a broad range of purchasers, including first time buyers, families and investors. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nThis is where the home begins, you enter in to modernisation with the current personal touch and beautiful tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 5.09m x 3.86m\nEntering into the living room we are taken back by the bespoke tiled inset electric fireplace, alcove space and wood flooring. The room is engulfed in natural light.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.25m x 4.15m\nStunning spacious fully fitted kitchen and dining area with marble effect counter tops and a lovely island sets the tone for breakfast mornings, dinner gatherings.\n\nConservatory - 4.5m x 3.19m\nBeautiful conservatory engulfed in natural light carrying through to the kitchen.\n\nUtility Room - 1.82m x 1.77m\nGood storage space, tiled flooring, access to rear garden.\n\nBathroom - 1.62m x 1.57m\nTiled flooring w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLanding - \n\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.31m x 2.28m\nFully tiled with w.c, w.h.b, bath and shower.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.4m x 2.66m\nBeautiful bright first bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nPrimary Bedroom - 4.57m x 3.63m\nSpacious primary bedroom complemented with an en-suite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.69m x 1m\nWith w.c, w.h.b, shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.63m x 3.63m\nPerfectly proportionate second bedroom filled with natural light.\n\n"
      },
